«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  GammaAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "GammaAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → av scv Xv « av 0 + scv 0 + Xv 0 + → a sc X « 'IFTE(X≤0;0;GammaP(a;X/sc))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X≤0;0;(X^(a-1))*EXP(-X/sc)/((sc^a)*Γ(a)))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1-Kc' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'a*sc' →Num "μ" →Tag '√(a)*sc' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE av scv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
